WEBVTT

00:04:56.913 --> 00:05:00.621
was doing everything in his power
to win rights to the embryos.

00:05:01.371 --> 00:05:03.913
After losing in California court,

00:05:03.954 --> 00:05:07.996
he formed a trust
for the embryos in Louisiana.

00:05:08.871 --> 00:05:12.496
He even named the embryos
Emma and Isabella,

00:05:12.538 --> 00:05:15.871
and had them file a lawsuit
against Vergara,

00:05:15.913 --> 00:05:19.663
demanding that they be brought to birth.

00:05:19.704 --> 00:05:21.246
(Audience murmurs)

00:05:21.288 --> 00:05:26.121
Ultimately, the lawsuit was dismissed
for lack of jurisdiction,

00:05:26.121 --> 00:05:29.538
meaning Louisiana wasn't the right
place to hear the case.

00:05:29.579 --> 00:05:31.871
The embryos were
in Los Angeles, California.